Last Embrace is a thriller, mystery, romance film directed by Jonathan Demme.

3
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:06,000
Secret agent Harry Hannan suffers a mental breakdown when a botched
mission in Mexico results in the death of his wife.

4
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:06,000
He is sent to a mental asylum, after which he eventually returns to work.

5
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:06,000
But, once again, he begins to doubt his sanity when he
receives a bizarre death threat written in Hebrew.

6
00:36:00,000 --> 00:36:06,000
Not knowing which of his colleagues wants to kill him, Hannan teams up with pretty
young college student Ellie Fabian to attempt to unravel the mystery.

